<title>GERMANY: Suedzucker up stake in Berlin food company.</title>
<headline>Suedzucker up stake in Berlin food company.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German sugar processor Suedzucker AG said it had increased its stake in Berlin-based grocery producer Freiberger Lebensmittel GmbH &amp; Co Produktions -und Vertriebs KG to 50.1 percent from 25.1 percent.</p>
<p>The two companies have been cooperating for the past eight years, Suedzucker said in a statement. The purchase price for the additional stake was not revealed.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
